Tunneler - third-party parts and credits
(the project itself is public domain, see LICENSE)

The original TUNNELER 2.0 (1991) by Geoffrey Silverton was released by its author into the public domain.
The VGA font data (src/js/vgafont.js) is the standard IBM VGA 8x16 font; the extra letters in
src/js/glyphs.js come from the Linux console font Uni2-VGA16 (kbd project).
The glyphs in src/fonts/unifont/ (any other letters and emoji in player names, room names and chat)
are from GNU Unifont 16.0.04 (Roman Czyborra, Paul Hardy and contributors), licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1 / GNU GPL 2+ with the font embedding exception - see src/fonts/unifont/LICENSE.
